{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09477","headline":"马明生遇神女歌 · 韦应物","name":"马明生遇神女歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学仙贵功亦贵精，神女变化感马生。\n石壁千寻啓双检，中有玉堂铺玉簟。\n立之一隅不与言，玉体安隐三日眠。\n马生一立心转坚，知其丹白蒙哀怜。\n安期先生来起居，请示金铛玉佩天皇书。\n神女呵责不合见，仙子谢过手足战。\n大瓜玄枣冷如冰，海上摘来朝霞凝。\n赐仙复坐对食讫，颔之使去随烟升。\n乃言马生合不死，少姑教勅令付尔。\n安期再拜将生出，一授素书天地毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}